    "notation_profile": "oppenheim-2e-ct-dt-v1",
    "stem": "若 \\(x(t)=\\delta(t+2)-\\delta(t-2)\\)，则 \\(y(t)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}x(\\tau)d\\tau\\) 等于什么？",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "content": "\\(u(t-2)-u(t+2)\\)",
        "error_tag": "WRONG_SHIFT_DIRECTION"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "content": "\\(u(t+2)+u(t-2)\\)",
        "error_tag": "SIGN_ERROR"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "content": "\\(u(t+2)-u(t-2)\\)",
        "error_tag": null
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "content": "\\(\\delta(t+2)-\\delta(t-2)\\)",
        "error_tag": "FORGOT_INTEGRATION"
      }
    ],
    "correct_option": "C",
    "explanation": "正确：从负无穷积分把每个冲激变成同位置、同系数的阶跃，所以得到 \\(u(t+2)-u(t-2)\\)。错误项主要混淆平移正负号、冲激系数符号或忘记积分。易错点：\\(\\delta(t-t_0)\\) 积分为 \\(u(t-t_0)\\)。",
    "source": {
      "type": "KEY_EXERCISE",
      "reference": "重点习题1.13的冲激积分关系，压缩为一步判断题。",
